WEBVTT

00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:30.458
and with dozens of metal strings.

00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:34.059
It's a family heirloom,

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:36.184
a link between my past,

00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:38.434
the country where my parents were born,

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.059
and the future,

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:41.792
the unknown places I'll take it.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:46.059
I didn't actually realize it
at the time I got it,

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:50.125
but it would later become
a powerful metaphor for my work.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.684
We all know the saying,

00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:55.042
"There's no time like the present."

00:00:56.167 --> 00:01:00.000
But nowadays, it can feel
like there's no time but the present.